<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '20px 72px 0px 72px', background: '#F5F8F2', position: 'relative' }}>

  <Box style={{ height: 108, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 600, color: '#056526', letterSpacing: 2.4 }}>GOVERNANCE</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 700, color: '#0B1F14', letterSpacing: -0.6, marginTop: 8 }}>Trust is a feature, not a claim</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 532, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 52 }}>

    <Box style={{ width: 690, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.1)' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#056526', width: 42, lineHeight: 1 }}>1</Text>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F14' }}>Identity comes from a code, not a form</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.62)', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 5 }}>
            Staff accounts are created only by a single-use invite, stored as a SHA-256 hash with an expiry. The role is resolved inside the database, so a client cannot ask for one.
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.1)' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#056526', width: 42, lineHeight: 1 }}>2</Text>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F14' }}>Every table is scoped at the row</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.62)', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 5 }}>
            Row-level security is on for every table. A farmer reads their own rows; an officer reads their jurisdiction. Analytics are SQL functions, so aggregates are filtered before they are counted.
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.1)' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#056526', width: 42, lineHeight: 1 }}>3</Text>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F14' }}>Collect less than you could</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.62)', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 5 }}>
            Coordinates are rounded to three decimals server-side, roughly 110 metres. Photos sit in a private bucket and are never used for training unless the farmer opts in.
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, paddingTop: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#056526', width: 42, lineHeight: 1 }}>4</Text>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F14' }}>The record is written by the server</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.62)', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 5 }}>
            Account, role and scan events land in an audit table that clients cannot insert into. A rejected scan is logged as a data-quality event and kept out of every aggregate.
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.1)', borderRadius: 10, padding: 22 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 600, color: '#056526', letterSpacing: 1.6 }}>THE CONSENT SWITCH</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 15, color: '#0B1F14', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 10 }}>
          "Allow reviewed photo use" is off by default, per account, and reversible. Nothing is used to train a model unless a farmer turns it on.
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginTop: 14 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 34, height: 18, borderRadius: 9, background: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.15)', padding: 2 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 14, height: 14, borderRadius: 7, background: '#FFFFFF' }} />
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.5)' }}>Default state: off</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ borderTop: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.12)', paddingTop: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 600, color: '#056526', letterSpacing: 1.6 }}>WHAT IS NOT STORED</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.62)', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 6 }}>
          Retakes, rejections and uncertain results. A scan the model was not sure about never becomes a row in the farmer's record.
        </Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ borderTop: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.12)', paddingTop: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 15, fontStyle: 'italic', color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.7)', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
          Privacy here is enforced by policy, not by a paragraph in the terms.
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-start', paddingTop: 16, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.1)' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.45)' }}>AgriSuri PH · Product Scope</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.45)' }}>16 / 19</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
